{"results":[{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/anchor-south-ridge/112932/project","title":"Anchor South Ridge Malabar Hill, Mumbai | 3 BHK Flats Price List ...","raw_content":"# Anchor South Ridge Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/anchor-daewoo-industries-ltd-20471-3208.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\nAnchor South Ridge is situated in Malabar Hill, Mumbai, offering a range of 3 BHK Flats. Developed by Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd, this residential project features 2 homes. The development is priced from ₹ 1.97 Cr up to ₹ 11.23 Cr, with 3 BHK: ₹ 11.23 Cr available.With a launch date of Aug 2017, the project is strategically located near NRP Sheth Multipurpose High School, Malabar Hill, Wilson College, Kamathipura, Walkeshwar Temple, Malabar Hill and benefits from Eastern Express Highway, Lamington Road. The pincode for this location is 400006. It offers units with starting area of 358 Sq.Ft. and ending area of 2041 Sq.Ft.. P51900011067 ensures transparency and reliability.\n\n Residents can enjoy Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, Normal Park / Central Green, Indoor Games, enhancing their lifestyle. This property provides a blend of comfort and convenience for modern families.\n\n![Anchor South Ridge Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/anchor-south-ridge-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-520;h-260;crop;)\n\n**₹1.97 Cr - 11.23 Cr**\n\n₹74,250 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Anchor South Ridge?\n\n## About Anchor South Ridge, Malabar Hill by Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd\n\nAnchor South Ridge is an exclusive luxury residential development by Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd, located in the prestigious neighbourhood of Malabar Hill, Mumbai. Offering elegantly designed 3 BHK residences with spacious layouts ranging from 358 Sq.Ft. to 2041 Sq.Ft., the project blends sophistication, comfort, and urban convenience. Strategically connected via Eastern Express Highway, Lamington Road, residents enjoy seamless access to premium schools, healthcare centres, business hubs, hotels, and shopping destinations.\n\nCrafted with premium specifications and modern architecture, Anchor South Ridge delivers a refined living experience in one of the city’s most sought-after locations. With strong connectivity and high investment potential in Mumbai South, the project stands as an ideal choice for luxury homebuyers and investors alike.\n\n## Anchor South Ridge Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\nThe homes at Anchor South Ridge are available in 3 BHK Flats. These residences are priced starting from ₹ 1.97 Cr and range up to ₹ 11.23 Cr. For those seeking specific layouts, 3 BHK: ₹ 11.23 Cr provides a breakdown of costs\n\nThe pricing structure offers 2 different configurations, with options like Studio at ₹ 1.97 Cr for an area of 358 Sq. Ft., and 3 BHK Apartment available at ₹ 11.23 Cr covering 2041 Sq. Ft.. The average asking price in the locality is ₹ 95,700 /Sq.Ft.\n\nThe average rental price in the locality is around ₹ 234 /Sq.Ft., and the average rental price, BHK-wise, is 1 BHK with price ₹ 97.1 K, 2 BHK with price ₹ 2 L, 3 BHK with price ₹ 3.8 L, 4 BHK with price ₹ 4.9 L.\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Anchor South Ridge.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Studio  358 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.97 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  2041 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 11.23 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nAnchor South Ridge's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malabar Hill.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Anchor South Ridge | Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 74250 | 80650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 72450 | 95700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 70450 | 92350 |\n| Sep 2025 | 52050 | 76750 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nAnchor South Ridge avg. price is ₹ 74.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malabar Hill at ₹ 80.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Hubtown Ackruti Astha](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/hubtown-ackruti-astha/103655/project \"Hubtown Ackruti Astha\") | ₹ 96,550 |\n| Malabar Hill | ₹ 80,650 |\n| Current Project **Anchor South Ridge** | ₹ 74,250 |\n| [Rohan Lifescapes Shubham](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rohan-lifescapes-shubham/102832/project \"Rohan Lifescapes Shubham\") | ₹ 57,850 |\n| [Ajmera Midtown](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-midtown/62379/project \"Ajmera Midtown\") | ₹ 55,550 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malabar Hill ranges from ₹ 97.1 K to ₹ 4.9 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Anchor South Ridge | In Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 97.1 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 4.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Anchor South Ridge.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Anchor South Ridge moved from ₹ 72,450/sqft to ₹ 74,250/sqft, reflecting a 2.48% rise.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Anchor South Ridge moved from ₹ 70,450/sqft to ₹ 72,450/sqft, reflecting a 2.84% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Anchor South Ridge moved from ₹ 52,050/sqft to ₹ 70,450/sqft, reflecting a 35.35% rise.\n\nStructural Works reach 100% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 98% completion, Internal finishing stands at 100%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 100% done.\n\nStructural Works reach 98% completion, External Works has reached 100%, Internal finishing stands at 60%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 80% done.\n\nSouth Ridge, developed by Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd., officially launched on 31-Aug-2017 and expected to complete by 30-Jan-2022. Registered under RERA No. P51900011067. The project comprises 1 towers and offers 4 residential units, including MULTIPURPOSE ROOM, NON RESIDENTIAL, 1 RK, 3 BHK, with unit sizes ranging from 355 to 2303 Square feet across a total area of 0.48 Acre.\n\n## Anchor South Ridge Floor Plans\n\nThe homes at Anchor South Ridge are available in 3 BHK Flats. These residences are priced starting from ₹ 1.97 Cr and range up to ₹ 11.23 Cr. For those seeking specific layouts, 3 BHK: ₹ 11.23 Cr provides a breakdown of costs\n\nThe pricing structure offers 2 different configurations, with options like Studio at ₹ 1.97 Cr for an area of 358 Sq. Ft., and 3 BHK Apartment available at ₹ 11.23 Cr covering 2041 Sq. Ft.. The average asking price in the locality is ₹ 95,700 /Sq.Ft.\n\nThe average rental price in the locality is around ₹ 234 /Sq.Ft., and the average rental price, BHK-wise, is 1 BHK with price ₹ 97.1 K, 2 BHK with price ₹ 2 L, 3 BHK with price ₹ 3.8 L, 4 BHK with price ₹ 4.9 L.\n\n### 3 BHK 2041 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 11.23 Cr**\n\n### 358 Sq. Ft. Studio\n\n(Carpet Area)\n\nPrice: **₹ 1.97 Cr**\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Anchor South Ridge\n\nResidents at Anchor South Ridge can enjoy a vibrant lifestyle with access to Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, Normal Park / Central Green, Indoor Games. These amenities cater to diverse interests, ensuring something for everyone. This development focuses on creating a community-centric environment for homebuyers.\n\nThe focus is on enhancing the living experience for all residents. This project provides an ideal setting for families and individuals alike. The developer aims to create a harmonious blend of comfort and convenience for all.\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-indoorga-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd Malabar Hill\n\nAnchor South Ridge is situated at Malabar Hill Mumbai, offering excellent connectivity. The location benefits from proximity to NRP Sheth Multipurpose High School, Malabar Hill, Wilson College, Kamathipura, Walkeshwar Temple, Malabar Hill and enjoys seamless access via Eastern Express Highway, Lamington Road. The locality has a connectivity index of 4.0, ensuring ease of travel.\n\nThe area is well-supported by public transportation, making commutes convenient for residents. With NRP Sheth Multipurpose High School, Manav Mandir High School, Walsingham House School, Gopi Birla Memorial School, Sava Sadan Society School and Syndicate Bank, Sbi Bank, ICICI Bank, Standard Chartered Bank, Central Bankof India? in close proximity, daily errands and educational needs are easily met.\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai South](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Anchor South Ridge.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Anchor South Ridge](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/anchor-south-ridge-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Nrp Sheth Multipurpose High School\n\n#### Malbar Hill Post Office\n\n#### St Elizabeth Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malabar Hill\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\n![Locality rank](/assets/images/key-insights-icon/locality-rank.svg)\n\nBased on demand, livability, and activity\n\nMalabar Hill remains one of the peaceful and scenic localities in Mumbai. The abundance of lush green spaces like Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park, combined with stunning views of the Arabian Sea, offers a serene escape from the city's fast pace. The roads are well-maintained, street lighting is good, and the neighborhood feels safe even late at night. Access to top-tier schools, premier healthcare facilities, and South Mumbai's key business hubs makes living here incredibly convenient and comfortable.\n\n— SOURABH, Owner\n\n## RERA Details of Anchor South Ridge\n\nAnchor South Ridge is currently Ready to Move, ensuring a smooth transition for future residents. Registered under P51900011067, this development offers assurance and transparency in its construction and delivery. The project was launched on Aug 2017, marking the beginning of this residential opportunity. It is designed to meet the needs of modern families, with a focus on timely completion and adherence to regulatory standards. The announced possession date is Jan 2020, promising a future of comfortable living.\n\n## How does Anchor South Ridge compare with similar projects?\n\n![Anchor South Ridge project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-anchor-south-ridge-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Anchor South Ridge](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/anchor-south-ridge/112932/project \"Anchor South Ridge\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Sunrise Venetia project in Marine Lines, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sunrise-venetia-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Sunrise Venetia](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/sunrise-venetia/11041/project \"Sunrise Venetia\")\n\nMarine Lines, Mumbai\n\n![Ajmera Midtown project in Kalbadevi, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-midtown-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Ajmera Midtown](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-midtown/62379/project \"Ajmera Midtown\")\n\nKalbadevi, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd Track Record\n\n![Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/anchor-daewoo-industries-ltd-20471-3208.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nAnchor South Ridge is developed by Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd, known for their commitment to quality and innovation in residential developments. The developer has a strong track record with 1 completed projects, showcasing their expertise in creating thriving communities. They focus on delivering homes that meet the evolving needs of modern families.\n\nThis developer is dedicated to providing exceptional living spaces, with a keen eye for detail and customer satisfaction. Their projects reflect a commitment to sustainable practices and innovative design. The company aims to create lasting value for homebuyers through thoughtful planning and execution. They strive to build homes that enhance the lifestyle of residents.\n\n![Ashok Patil Nityanand residential project in Girgaon](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ashok-patil-nityanand-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGirgaon, Mumbai\n\n2,3 BHK\n\n₹ 4.21 Cr to 9.38 Cr\n\n![Hubtown Ackruti Astha residential project in Malabar Hill](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-hubtown-ackruti-astha-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=