e at Anchor South Ridge.\n\n### What is the total area of a 3 BHK apartment in Anchor South Ridge?\n\nA 3 BHK apartment in Anchor South Ridge has a total area of 2041 Sq. Ft.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/home-loan.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/valuation.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/sell-or-rent-property.png)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n![Lodha](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg)\n![Kalpataru](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg)\n![Hiranandani](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/hiranandani-451.jpg)\n![Runwal](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/runwal-538-4155.jpg)\n![Rustomjee](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rustomjee-599.jpg)\n![Mayfair Housing](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mayfair-housing-585.jpg)\n![Godrej](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/godrej-49-2414.jpg)\n![Chandak](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/chandak-1050.jpg)\n![Mahindra Lifespaces](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahindra-lifespaces-68.jpg)\n![Shapoorji Pallonji](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/shapoorji-pallonji-494.jpg)\n![Kalpataru Vian](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-vian-project-project-large-image1-5543-opt-460392f9-2d11-4a1c-b830-fba5e810b682.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Ahana](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-ahana-project-project-large-image1-4621-opt-3fdf8c3f-c784-42fd-b0f5-4398c6901234.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Purva Estrella](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/purva-estrella-project-project-large-image1-3989-opt-3a6c3ad5-4526-45bf-b146-a3e451ce03ed.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Adani Linkbay Residences](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/adani-linkbay-residences-project-project-large-image1-2560.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-project-large-image1-2484.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Rainforest](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-rainforest-project-project-large-image1-5108-opt-1de55a7d-9847-4c14-bd04-8125e6d5a57d.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Meadows](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-meadows-project-project-large-image1-8749-opt-0576b543-8352-4304-ab97-6c63b05f3057.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![GHP Mars Suncity](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ghp-mars-suncity-project-project-large-image1-7362.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Bliss](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-bliss-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Elixir Reserve](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-elixir-reserve-project-project-large-image1-6960.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![voice search]()\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.quikr.com/homes/project/anchor-south-ridge+malabar-hill+mumbai+229042","title":"Anchor South Ridge in Mumbai - Amenities, Layout, Price list, Floor Plan, Reviews - QuikrHomes","raw_content":"![Anchor South Ridge - project photo](https://teja8.kuikr.com/restatic/build/image/Project_default.png)\n\n# Anchor South Ridge by Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd. Mumbai [Malabar Hill](https://www.quikr.com/homes/locality/malabar_hill-mumbai/12), Mumbai\n\n## *₹* Price on Request Share\n\n### 17 Floors\n\n### Ready to Occupy Completed in Jan-22\n\n### 1 RK & 3 BHK Apartments\n\n### P51900011067 ... Show more\n\n# Anchor South Ridge by Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd. Mumbai [Malabar Hill](https://www.quikr.com/homes/locality/malabar_hill-mumbai/12), Mumbai\n\n## Nearby Places and Landmarks\n\n## About Anchor South Ridge [View Similar Projects](javascript:void(0))\n\nAnchor South Ridge provides marvelous Residential Apartments which promises you a life that is both lavish and Peaceful. With a fine elevation and all modern-day amenities at your disposal, the Anchor South Ridge offers you a choice between 1 RK and 3 BHK Apartments that finely blend impeccable planning and flawless taste together. The Project is located in Malabar Hill, Mumbai and is built to give you a sense of space, comfort and luxury under one roof. Presently project is completed. Anchor South Ridge is spread over area of 0.47 acres. It comprises of all world class amenities such as 24Hrs Water Supply, 24Hrs Backup Electricity, CCTV Cameras, Covered Car Parking, Fire Safety, Landscaped Garden, Lift, Play Area, Rain Water Harvesting and Security Personnel.\n\nLocation Advantages:. The Anchor South Ridge is strategically located with close proximity to schools, colleges, hospitals, shopping malls, grocery stores, restaurants, recreational centres etc. The complete address of Anchor South Ridge is Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra, INDIA..\n\nBuilder Information:. Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd. Mumbai is a leading group in real-estate market in Mumbai. This builder group has earned its name and fame because of timely delivery of world class Residential Apartments and quality of material used according to the demands of the customers.\n\n## Floor Plan & Price List\n\n## Anchor South Ridge Amenities\n\n## Gallery\n\n## Location\n\n## About Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd. Mumbai\n\nAnchor Daewoo Industries Ltd. is a well-known player in real estate industry, and their focus from day one has been to provide the best quality real estate products. Apart from that, they provide the best customer service and the uncompromising values. The company's main goal is to provide the best real estate services in all the areas they serve.\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n## Similar Search\n\n## Discussion Board\n\n##### Discussions\n\nAre you Sure you want to Delete?\n\n## Anchor South Ridge in Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Price List\n\n### 1 RK Apartment\n\n### 358 Sq. Ft. (33.26 Sq.M)\n\n### On Request\n\n### 3 BHK Apartment\n\n### 2041 Sq. Ft. (189.62 Sq.M)\n\n### On Request\n\n## Useful Links\n\nQuikrHomes is here to make your journey to a new home, simple and memorable. So we decided to bring you a platform which allows you to browse through millions of property listings across 900+ cities in India. You can now do a quick and convenient search for apartments, commercial properties, land-plots and other real estate properties in Bangalore. Now buying and renting comes with the freedom of ease and comfort. You can even refine your search results based on price, number of rooms, area size, locality and other relevant property amenities. And if you need any help, give us a call  08067364545\n\nThe information provided herein have been collected from publicly available sources, and is yet to be verified as per RERA guidelines.\\*\n[Read more..](javascript:void(0);)\n\nThe information sources used here include onsite interviews, marketing material and other information sources on the internet. The information related to ownership of this property are also based on material gathered from public sources mentioned above or as has been declared to us by the owners/person listing the property. These data have not yet been verified against authentic documents, and are only indicative of the actual situation of this property, project or land holding, and their ownership.\n\nAt QuikrHomes, we provide this information to help our users find publicly available data in a structured format. We are in the process of connecting with the relevant owners and verifying the data as per the provisions of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016. We will keep updating the information here regularly. While we believe that the information provided to you is correct on the basis of the data provided to us, please consider this data and information as indicative and use your judgement and verify any information before making any decision. [Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![](//:0)\n\n### Receive Email Alerts for more Properties!\n\nGet the best properties matching your requirements via Email\n\nSomeone will get in touch with you on:  \n and\n\n![](//:0)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.nobroker.in/anchor-south-ridge-malabar-hill_mumbai-prjt-8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267","title":"Anchor South Ridge Malabar Hill: Price, Photos & Floor Plans","raw_content":"![NoBroker](https://assets.nobroker.in/static/img/logos/nb_logo_new_trans.svg)\n![pay](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/payrent.png)\n![menu](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/hamburger-menu.svg)\n![Anchor South Ridge](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267/images/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267_project_image_HRjPWw2yaY1767774208392_46732_iris_medium.jpg)\n![Anchor South Ridge](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267/images/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267_project_image_kqLm4hu6Oz1767774208589_89358_iris_medium.jpg)\n![Anchor South Ridge](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267/images/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267_project_image_Sa2f2Q59c31767774209273_32760_iris_medium.jpg)\n![Anchor South Ridge](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267/images/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267_project_image_c1eJko46z31783167644942_45281_iris_medium.jpg)\n\nView All 7 Photos\n\n![Anchor South Ridge](https://assets.nobroker.in/media/building/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267/images/8a9f87859941ebbd01994258dcf63267_project_image_9feazNgm381767774209177_79870_iris_medium.jpg)\n![Rera](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/reraProjectInfo.svg)\n![share](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-common%2FShareNew_react_443425.webp&w=48&q=75)\n\n# Anchor South Ridge\n\n![pointer](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pointerProjectInfo.svg)\n![Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd logo](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/pi-builder-office.webp)\n\n## By Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd\n\n![formard](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/ArrowForwardBlack_nbReact_453525.svg)\n![house](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/houseProjectInfo.svg)\n![drop](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/dropProjectInfo.svg)\n![building](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/buildingProjectInfo.svg)\n![building](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/buildingProjectInfo.svg)\n![frame](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/frameProjectInfo.svg)\n![claim](/nb-ReactNextNew/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.nobroker.in%2Fnob-merchandise%2FclaimbenefitsIcon_nbReact221sor.webp&w=3840&q=75)\n![right](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowProjectInfo.svg)\n![download](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/downloadProjectInfo.svg)\n\n## Properties in Anchor South Ridge\n\n## Key Features\n\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n![star-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/star_nbReact_123455434.svg)\n\n## Anchor South Ridge Floor Plans\n\n## Amenities in Anchor South Ridge\n\n## Anchor South Ridge - RERA & Legal Certificates\n\n![view](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Eye.svg)\n\nThe Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 is Act of the Parliament of India which seeks to protect buyers as well as help boost investments in the real estate industry. The Act came into force from 1 May 2016.\n\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![copy](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Copy.svg)\n![approved](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rera_approved_seal.png)\n![Timely Dispute Resolution](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Question.svg)\n![Quality Assurance](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/SealCheck.svg)\n![Buyer Protection](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ShieldCheck.svg)\n![Transparency & Tracking](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/FileMagnifyingGlass.svg)\n\n## Anchor South Ridge - Neighbourhood\n\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/CTAbg.webp)\n\n### Looking for your dream home?\n\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/house.svg)\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/lightbulb-filament.svg)\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ListChecks.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowWhite.svg)\n\n## Compare Projects\n\n## Price Trend for Anchor South Ridge\n\n![connect_img](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/connectPropertyImg.webp)\n\n## Top Developers in Mumbai\n\n## Builders\n\nNo builders found\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### Where is Anchor South Ridge located?\n\n### What is the available Apartment size in Anchor South Ridge?\n\n### What is the RERA Number of Anchor South Ridge of Malabar Hill?\n\n### What is the price range of Anchor South Ridge of Malabar Hill?\n\n### Where to download the Anchor South Ridge brochure?\n\n### Where to download the Anchor South Ridge floor plan?\n\n### What is the nearest landmark to Anchor South Ridge residential project?\n\n### What amenities are available at Anchor South Ridge residential project?\n\n### Does Anchor South Ridge residential project have covered car parking?\n\n### Which banks can approve loans for Anchor South Ridge residential project?\n\n### Is a transportation facility easily available near Anchor South Ridge residential project?\n\n![chat](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/Common/chatLightBg.svg)\n\n## Sale Properties in Anchor South Ridge\n\nRequest Floor Plan\n\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\nRequest Floor Plan\n\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\n## About the Builder\n\n### Anchor Daewoo Industries Ltd\n\nAnchor Daewoo Industries Ltd has been been one of the most premium real estate developer in India since its inception. It has firmly established itself as one of the leading and successful developers of real estate in India by imprinting its mark across all the classes. With years of market experience and a rich bag of clients, it has provided its customers a rich living experience with the best housing infrastructure.\n\n## Anchor South Ridge - Neighbourhood\n\n![nearby-dummy-map](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n## More Projects in the Malabar Hill Area\n\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/caret-right-bold.svg)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.aurumproptech.in/pulse/rera/maharashtra/mumbai-city/south-ridge-P51900011067","title":"South Ridge - – RERA No. P51900011067 | Official Project Details & Status","raw_content":"![](https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=1784413262114415&ev=PageView&noscript=1)\n![pulse logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FPropTech_Pulse_logo.png&w=1200&q=75)\n![pulse